I found a rather funny (pure) solution to the dollar auction game.

The first player begins with a bid of exactly $1. All other players
realize their highest payoff is obtained by not bidding at all. So,
the first player wins. The payoff is zero for all players.

I don't know if there's a mixed solution to this game. Perhaps you know?
